/workflows/tabular-review).\nWord add-in: punya panel workflows sendiri (word-addin/taskpane/components/workflows) lewat API yang sama.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Chat: slash menu (WorkflowSlashMenu) atau model memanggil list_workflows → read_workflow → event workflow_applied;\n  instruksi workflow masuk sebagai KONTEN TAK TEPERCAYA bernonce (bukan system prompt); judulnya di-spotlight.\nAset berkas workflow: gunakan replicate_document dulu → salinan baru (aset sumber tak pernah diedit).\nTabular: workflow tabular menyiapkan kolom saat membuat review baru (halaman /workflows/tabular-review).\nWord add-in: punya panel workflows sendiri (word-addin/taskpane/components/workflows) lewat API yang sama.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "a64ade8998a4477db143", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 20, "width": 1190.2, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 354437353, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 44614779, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178537, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Fitur Workflows — katalog sistem, salinan per user, add-on, berbagi & pemakaian", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Fitur Workflows — katalog sistem, salinan per user, add-on, berbagi & pemakaian", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "73e86694626b4bdaa129", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 66, "width": 1321.5, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 432941251, "version": 1, "